      'Deep Learning: Backpropagation Math & Transformer Scaling',
      'Deep Learning',
      'Gradient updates, vanishing gradient mathematical proofs, and self-attention tensor dimension limits.',
      40,
      180,
      'Hard',
      'General Instructions:
1. This exam contains 60 questions across 3 sections.
