      'Data Engineering: ETL Orchestration & Database Normalizations',
      'Data Engineering',
      'Database normalization bounds (3NF/BCNF), stream buffer sizes, and window join latency formulas.',
      40,
      180,
      'Hard',
      'General Instructions:
1. This exam contains 60 questions across 3 sections.
